---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Built | Rahul Paul">
	<main class="wrap">
		<section class="page-hero">
			<span class="page-chip">Built</span>
			<h1>Small products, built to learn quickly.</h1>
			<p class="lede">This is where my personal vibe-coding projects will live—each with its own product story and, eventually, its own subdomain.</p>
		</section>
		<section class="built-placeholder">
			<h2>The workshop is open. The first builds are taking shape.</h2>
			<div>
				<p>I'm documenting the problem, product decisions, build process and what changed after shipping—not just the final screen.</p>
				<div class="mini-tags"><span>Problem framing</span><span>Prototype</span><span>Build notes</span><span>Learnings</span></div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
